    {
      "key": "Sandbox_VehicleLivingSlots_TelevisionPowerConsumption_tooltip",
      "en": "Displayed at 1000 times the television's actual auxiliary-battery drain per active game minute. Default: 0.4, matching the microwave rate. Minimum: 0.01. A charged auxiliary battery is required.",
      "cn": "电视机开启时每游戏分钟实际耗电量的 1000 倍显示值。默认 0.4，与微波炉相同；最小 0.01，须安装有电的副电瓶。",
      "ch": "電視機開啟時每遊戲分鐘實際耗電量的 1000 倍顯示值。預設 0.4，與微波爐相同；最小 0.01，須安裝有電的副電瓶。",
